//Translations: "Why do the Resistance clockwork attack Antimatter's clockwork? The efficency of Antimatter's clockwork is better than the efficiency of the Resistance Clockwork. Antimatter's Clockwork are better than Resistance clockwork.", "The probability of victory for Antimatter's Clockwork is 94%.", "Antimatter's Clockwork task is to attack Resistance clockwork. If Antimatter Clockwork's attack task is complete, then Antimatter's Clockwork will repair the Resistance Clockwork.", "Resistance Clockwork is not equal to Antimatter's Clockwork." "Antimatter's Clockwork task is to defend the Underground. The Resistance Clockwork will not break the Underground."

